{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（2日）早上9時許，尖沙咀彌敦道83至97號華源大廈一名男子報案稱遇劫受傷。警方到場調查，事主稱在樓上單位被人用硬物襲擊，掠去手提電話和銀包，眼部及耳朵受傷。</p><p>現場消息指，事主與涉案人士互相認識；警方將案件列襲擊致身體受傷案調查，由救護車將傷者送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171773350616371200367214.jpeg/LvNdPpcirx1Iy4sdg_3kswsYMzGj5gLwumCX97pgl_c\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是彌敦道華源大廈。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171773353489600512805273.jpeg/c-4vbPuiVSQL-zeCMqWjimnbX-whSaeJnBO9_JwTvfw\"/><figcaption>現場是彌敦道華源大廈。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是華源大廈。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171773347713781760942761.jpeg/oyRey2dObNvvrSK5yL8vTKVEgk1U5P4R01ykitNcpIo\"/><figcaption>現場是華源大廈。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主送院治理。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171773356216029184438901.jpeg/MbNqsOQ7rKSAdyb8S3noWRJHrOCMOadBGwJj0D4CY9A\"/><figcaption>事主送院治理。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T03:23:59.141011+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}